#: ProcessModel.cc:217
msgid "- Process is doing some work"
msgstr "- प्रक्रियाले केही कार्य गरिरहेकोछ"

#: ProcessModel.cc:219
msgid "- Process is waiting for something to happen"
msgstr "- प्रक्रियाले हुनु पर्ने केही कार्यका लागि प्रतिक्षा गरेकोछ"

#: ProcessModel.cc:221
msgid "- Process has been stopped. It will not respond to user input at the moment"
msgstr "- प्रक्रिया रोकिएकोछ । यो क्षणमा यसले प्रयोगकर्ता आगतलाई प्रतिक्रिया दिँदैन"

#: ProcessModel.cc:223
msgid ""
"- Process has finished and is now dead, but the parent process has not "
"cleaned up"
msgstr "- प्रक्रिया समाप्तभएको छ र अहिले निस्क्रिय छ, तर प्रमूल प्रक्रिया मेटिएको छैन"

#: ProcessModel.cc:474
#| msgid "User Processes"
msgid "The process name"
msgstr "प्रक्रिया नाम"

#: ProcessModel.cc:476
msgid "The user that owns this process"
msgstr "प्रयोगकर्ता जसले यो प्रक्रिया प्राप्त गर्दछ"

#: ProcessModel.cc:478
msgid "The controlling terminal that this process is running on."
msgstr "नियन्त्रण टर्मिनल जसले यो प्रक्रिया चलिरहेको छ ।"

#: ProcessModel.cc:480
msgid ""
"The priority that this process is being run with. Ranges from 19 (very nice, "
"least priority) to -19 (top priority)"
msgstr "प्राथमिकता जससँग यो प्रक्रिया चलिरहेको हुन्छ । १९ बाट दायराहरू (अति उत्तम न्यून प्राथमिकता) १९ सम्म (उच्च प्राथमिकता)"

#: ProcessModel.cc:482
msgid ""
"The current CPU usage of the process, divided by the number of processor "
"cores in the machine."
msgstr "प्रक्रियाको हालको सीपीयू उपयोग, जुन मेशिनमा प्रोसेसर कोरहरूको सङ्ख्याद्वारा भाग गरिएको हुन्छ ।"

#: ProcessModel.cc:484
#| msgid ""
#| "<qt>This is the amount of virtual memory space that the process is using, "
#| "included shared libraries, graphics memory, files on disk, and so on.  "
#| "This number is almost meaningless."
msgid ""
"<qt>This is the amount of virtual memory space that the process is using, "
"included shared libraries, graphics memory, files on disk, and so on. This "
"number is almost meaningless.</qt>"
msgstr "<qt>यो वास्तविक स्मृति खाली स्थानको मात्रा हो जुन प्रक्रियाले समावेश गरिएको साझेदारी लाइब्रेरी, ग्राफिक्स स्मृति, डिस्क फाइल इत्यादि प्रयोग गरिरहेको हुन्छ । यो नम्बर प्राय अर्थहीन हुन्छ ।</qt>"

#: ProcessModel.cc:486
#| msgid ""
#| "<qt>This is the amount of real physical memory that this process is using "
#| "by itself.  It does not include any swapped out memory, nor the code size "
#| "of its shared libraries.  This is often the most useful figure to judge "
#| "the memory use of a program.<br/><br/>"
msgid ""
"<qt>This is the amount of real physical memory that this process is using by "
"itself. It does not include any swapped out memory, nor the code size of its "
"shared libraries. This is often the most useful figure to judge the memory "
"use of a program.</qt>"
msgstr "<qt>यो वास्तविक भौतिक स्मृतिको मात्रा हो जुन यो प्रक्रिया आफैले प्रयोग गरिरहेको छ । यसले स्वाप बाहिर गएको कुनै स्मृति समाविष्ट गर्दैन, न त यसले आफ्नो साझेदारी लाइब्रेरीको साइजनै समावेश गर्छ । कार्यक्रमको स्मृति प्रयोग मूल्याङ्कन गर्ने यो कहिलेकाहीँ उपयोगी चित्रण हुन्छ ।</qt>"

#: ProcessModel.cc:488
#| msgid ""
#| "<qt>This is the amount of real physical memory that this process's shared "
#| "libraries are using.  This memory is shared among all processes that use "
#| "this library"
msgid ""
"<qt>This is the amount of real physical memory that this process's shared "
"libraries are using. This memory is shared among all processes that use this "
"library</qt>"
msgstr "<qt>यो वास्तविक भौतिक स्मृतिको मात्रा हो जुन यो प्रक्रियाको साझेदार गरिएका लाइब्रेरीहरू प्रयोग गरिरहेका छन् । यो स्मृति सबै प्रक्रियाहरू बीच साझेदार गरिएको हुन्छ जसले यो लाइब्रेरी प्रयोग गर्छ</qt>"

#: ProcessModel.cc:490
msgid "<qt>The command that this process was launched with</qt>"
msgstr "<qt>यो प्रक्रियासँग थालनी भएको आदेश</qt>"

#: ProcessModel.cc:492
msgid "<qt>The title of any windows that this process is showing</qt>"
msgstr "<qt>कुनै सञ्झ्यालको शीर्षक जुन यो प्रक्रियाले देखाइरहेको हुन्छ</qt>"

